<title>RUSSIA: Moscow international airport charges in June.</title>
<headline>Moscow international airport charges in June.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are charges for Moscow international airports, in roubles, for June, including landing fees per tonne maximum take off weight (L), maintenance fees on an hourly basis (M), per international passenger charges (P), international cargo/mail charges per kg (C), fuel charges per tonne (F) and charges for meteorological (W) data.</p>
<p>Charges do not include value added tax.</p>
<p>			     L	M	 P	 C    F   W</p>
<p>    Sheremetyevo	40,560 123,519 30,240   690  n/a   2,000</p>
<p>    Domodedovo	  38,550 110,000 30,000   825  n/a 240,625</p>
<p>    Vnukovo	     47,400 113,800 42,370 1,020  n/a 241,667</p>
<p>    Plane		Weight (tonne)   Plane	Weight (tonne)</p>
<p>    Ilyushin Il-62	161.6	   Antonov An-124    392.0</p>
<p>    Ilyushin Il-62M     167.0	   Antonov An-225    600.0</p>
<p>    Ilyushin Il-96-300  224.4	   Antonov An-32	27.0</p>
<p>    Ilyushin Il-86	210.0	   Antonov An-30	22.7</p>
<p>    Ilyushin Il-76T/TD  190.0	   Antonov An-28	 6.5</p>
<p>    Ilyushin Il-76MF    210.0	   Antonov An-26	24.0</p>
<p>    Tupolev Tu-154M     100.0	   Antonov An-24	21.8</p>
<p>    Tupolev Tu-154B	98.0	   Antonov An-12	61.0</p>
<p>    Tupolev Tu-204	 94.6	   Yakovlev Yak-40    16.1</p>
<p>    Tupolev Tu-134	 47.6	   Yakovlev Yak-42    54.0</p>
<p>Airport officials declined to say which dollar exchange rates would be used. The official exchange rate for the dollar on Monday was 5,783 roubles.</p>
<p>--Viktor Anoshkin, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
